{"id":57644,"date":"2026-08-07T16:05:32","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T15:05:32","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:15:55","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:15:55","slug":"maratona-de-viena","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-viena\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Viena 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona de Viena 2027<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona de Viena 2027<\/strong> (44\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <em>Vienna City Marathon<\/em>) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>18 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, com partida por vagas a partir das <strong>09h00<\/strong> em <strong>Wagramer Stra\u00dfe \/ Ponte Reichsbr\u00fccke<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 sede das Na\u00e7\u00f5es Unidas \u2013 UNO-City), em <strong>Viena, \u00c1ustria<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Enterprise Sport Promotion GmbH<\/strong> e distinguida com o selo <em>World Athletics Elite Label Road Race<\/em> e membro fundador das <em>European Marathon Classics<\/em>, a maior festa desportiva austr\u00edaca re\u00fane cerca de 45.000 a 50.000 atletas num fim de semana dedicado \u00e0 corrida e \u00e0 m\u00fasica cl\u00e1ssica.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Ao som da c\u00e9lebre valsa <em>O Dan\u00fabio Azul<\/em> de Johann Strauss II, o pelot\u00e3o atravessa o rio Dan\u00fabio rumo \u00e0 roda-gigante do parque <strong>Prater<\/strong> e \u00e0 hist\u00f3rica avenida <strong>Hauptallee<\/strong> (palco do sub-2 horas de Eliud Kipchoge), seguindo depois at\u00e9 ao Pal\u00e1cio Imperial de <strong>Sch\u00f6nbrunn<\/strong>, \u00e0 \u00d3pera Estatal e \u00e0 monumental <strong>Ringstra\u00dfe<\/strong>, com meta instalada em frente ao <strong>Burgtheater<\/strong> e \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal (<em>Wiener Rathausplatz<\/em>). Al\u00e9m da Maratona de 42,195 km (tempo limite de <strong>6h00 \/ fecho da meta \u00e0s 15h30<\/strong> e idade m\u00ednima de <strong>18 anos<\/strong>), o programa integra a <strong>Wiener St\u00e4dtische Halbmarathon<\/strong> (21,0975 km \u00e0s 09h00), o <strong>Powerade Staffelmarathon<\/strong> (estafetas de 4 atletas: 15,5 km + 6,0 km + 9,3 km + 11,4 km), o <strong>Tchibo Coffee Run 10K<\/strong> (domingo \u00e0s 08h00) e as provas de s\u00e1bado, 17 de abril, na Ringstra\u00dfe (<strong>Vienna 5K<\/strong> \u00e0s 18h15, <em>The Daily Mile<\/em> 1600\/800 e <em>Coca-Cola Inclusion Run<\/em>). Consulta tamb\u00e9m o guia completo das principais <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e planeia o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">18 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Wagramer Stra\u00dfe \/ Reichsbr\u00fccke (Partida) e Ringstra\u00dfe \/ Rathausplatz (Chegada), Viena, \u00c1ustria<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(