Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vienna City Marathon (42,195 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">115,00 \u20ac a 155,00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Wiener St\u00e4dtische Halbmarathon (21,0975 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">75,00 \u20ac a 99,00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Powerade Staffelmarathon (Estafetas 4x)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 18 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">190,00 \u20ac a 220,00 \u20ac \/ equipa<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida de Estrada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Tchibo Coffee Run 10K &#038; Vienna 5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 e 18 Abr \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:00 (10K Dom) | 18:15 (5K S\u00e1b)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">35,00 \u20ac a 48,00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rios e local de partida da Maratona de Viena 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 44\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vienna City Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 18 de abril de 2027. O Tchibo Coffee Run 10K parte \u00e0s 08h00 e a Maratona (42,195 km), Meia Maratona (21,0975 km) e Estafetas (Powerade Staffelmarathon) partem por vagas a partir das 09h00 na Wagramer Stra\u00dfe \/ Ponte Reichsbr\u00fccke, terminando na Ringstra\u00dfe (em frente ao Burgtheater e Rathausplatz). No s\u00e1bado, 17 de abril, realiza-se o Vienna 5K \u00e0s 18h15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e a idade m\u00ednima na Maratona de Viena?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Segundo as condi\u00e7\u00f5es gerais de participa\u00e7\u00e3o (Allgemeine Teilnahmebedingungen) da Enterprise Sport Promotion GmbH, o tempo m\u00e1ximo para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas (com encerramento oficial da meta \u00e0s 15h30), sendo exigida a idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos (nascidos em 2009 ou antes) para a Maratona e 16 anos para a Meia Maratona.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as regras sobre cadeiras de rodas, bicicletas ou equipamentos auxiliares?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos termos do \u00a7 2.3 do regulamento oficial (ATB), por motivos t\u00e9cnicos e de seguran\u00e7a na rota, n\u00e3o \u00e9 permitida a participa\u00e7\u00e3o com cadeiras de rodas ou handbikes na Maratona, Meia Maratona e Estafetas, nem o acompanhamento por bicicletas, patins ou trotinetes ou a presen\u00e7a de animais no percurso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde decorre o levantamento do dorsal para a Maratona de Viena?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante realiza-se na feira desportiva Vienna Sports World (VCM Expo), na sexta-feira (16 de abril) e no s\u00e1bado (17 de abril de 2027), mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o da confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial (ou procura\u00e7\u00e3o oficial assinada para recolha por terceiros nos termos do \u00a7 4.1 das ATB).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e a lista de espera oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas exclusivamente online em vienna-marathon.com por escal\u00f5es de vagas. Caso um escal\u00e3o ou dist\u00e2ncia esgote, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza uma lista de espera oficial (Warteliste) e o sistema oficial de transfer\u00eancia de dorsal at\u00e9 \u00e0 data-limite regulamentar, sendo estritamente proibida a revenda em plataformas externas (\u00a7 3.1 e \u00a7 4.2 das ATB).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Maratona de Viena 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-18\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Wagramer Stra\u00dfe \/ Reichsbr\u00fccke (Partida) e Ringstra\u00dfe \/ Rathausplatz (Chegada), Viena, \u00c1ustria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Viena\", \"addressRegion\": \"\u00c1ustria\", \"addressCountry\": \"AT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Enterprise Sport Promotion GmbH (Vienna City Marathon)\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hor\u00e1rios e local de partida da Maratona de Viena 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 44\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do Vienna City Marathon realiza-se no domingo, 18 de abril de 2027. O Tchibo Coffee Run 10K parte \u00e0s 08h00 e a Maratona (42,195 km), Meia Maratona (21,0975 km) e Estafetas (Powerade Staffelmarathon) partem por vagas a partir das 09h00 na Wagramer Stra\u00dfe \/ Ponte Reichsbr\u00fccke, terminando na Ringstra\u00dfe (em frente ao Burgtheater e Rathausplatz). No s\u00e1bado, 17 de abril, realiza-se o Vienna 5K \u00e0s 18h15.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e a idade m\u00ednima na Maratona de Viena?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Segundo as condi\u00e7\u00f5es gerais de participa\u00e7\u00e3o (Allgemeine Teilnahmebedingungen) da Enterprise Sport Promotion GmbH, o tempo m\u00e1ximo para concluir os 42,195 km \u00e9 de 6 horas (com encerramento oficial da meta \u00e0s 15h30), sendo exigida a idade m\u00ednima de 18 anos (nascidos em 2009 ou antes) para a Maratona e 16 anos para a Meia Maratona.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as regras sobre cadeiras de rodas, bicicletas ou equipamentos auxiliares?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Nos termos do \u00a7 2.3 do regulamento oficial (ATB), por motivos t\u00e9cnicos e de seguran\u00e7a na rota, n\u00e3o \u00e9 permitida a participa\u00e7\u00e3o com cadeiras de rodas ou handbikes na Maratona, Meia Maratona e Estafetas, nem o acompanhamento por bicicletas, patins ou trotinetes ou a presen\u00e7a de animais no percurso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde decorre o levantamento do dorsal para a Maratona de Viena?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento do dorsal e kit de participante realiza-se na feira desportiva Vienna Sports World (VCM Expo), na sexta-feira (16 de abril) e no s\u00e1bado (17 de abril de 2027), mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o da confirma\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e documento de identifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial (ou procura\u00e7\u00e3o oficial assinada para recolha por terceiros nos termos do \u00a7 4.1 das ATB).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e a lista de espera oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas exclusivamente online em vienna-marathon.com por escal\u00f5es de vagas. Caso um escal\u00e3o ou dist\u00e2ncia esgote, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza uma lista de espera oficial (Warteliste) e o sistema oficial de transfer\u00eancia de dorsal at\u00e9 \u00e0 data-limite regulamentar, sendo estritamente proibida a revenda em plataformas externas (\u00a7 3.1 e \u00a7 4.2 das ATB).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":70409,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,31,41],"event_type_2":[1383,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57644","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-viena-austria","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-austria","event_type_2-europa"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-maratona-de-viena.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57644","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=57644"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57644\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":70411,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57644\/revisions\/70411"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/70409"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=57644"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=57644"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=57644"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=57644"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=57644"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=57644"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=57644"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}